			title: "Gears Turn"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dExploring around Iromine, you may come across a strange laboratory. Inside of it is one of the few living creatures on Iromine: The Professor."
				""
				"&dThe Professor is another Power User like you, except they've survived in the game so long they've set up residence in whatever current iteration of Iromine exists. "
				""
				"&dThey have a lot of interesting things to trade, including the Mecha Gear. This is a very important. You'll need to level up you trades with them first. Mecha Gears are used in many crafting recipes..."
				""
				"&dIncluding the Incomplete weaponry you can find in Iro Crates."
			]
