			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dA lot of the Iro Crates seem to be used to store unfinished weaponry. Which is a bit of an issue since they could be useful to you, right?"
				""
				"&dWell, with a Mecha Gear and a Power Core, you can easily finish these weapons and use them yourself!"
				""
				"&dThere is a Crossbow, Bow, Assault Rifle, Cannon, Shotgun, and Staff that you can complete and collect."
