			description: [
				"&5Polytoms and Voltrons are hostile robots that spawn in Iromine. "
				""
				"&5Polytoms are flying creatures and will attack you with explosive projectiles. Voltrons can make lightning strike if they hit you."
				""
				"&5Voltrons can drop Power Cores, good for crafting. They can also drop Gold Springs, which are needed to summon the boss of Iromine."
