		{
			title: "Springing the Boss"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5You'll want to find a Professor in his Laboratory sooner rather than later, Bandit."
				""
				"&dYep, he's the main key to calling the Boss of Iromine: MechaBot. If you trade enough with them, the Professor will provide you with one of the special Gold Springs you need."
				""
				"&5Though, some of the other robots may have earned the permission to face the MechBot as well, so you may rarely find one after defeating some robots."
				""
				"&dThe Gold Spring is sort of a VIP pass for the Iromine residents. They allow robots to challenge the MechBot."
			]
			dependencies: ["20A8A0903136EE35"]
			id: "295B57EA4DC55761"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2C6DE2990E4B6C9E"
				type: "item"
