		{
			title: "Crystal World"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 3.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&dCrystevia is a world full of crystals. It's plant life are crystals. It's currency is crystals."
				""
				"&5And it's lifeforms are crystals. Crystalline constructs to be precise. "
				""
				"&dLike the Deeplands, the world is one giant cave system. So make sure you got some nightvision or something."
				""
				"&5Perfect for grappling hooks!"
				""
				"&dYes yes brother. But Bandit needs to get there first. The Crystevia Realmstone can be obtained by taking one of those Deep Crystals in the Deeplands, and Right Clicking it onto a Case Construct."
				""
				"&5Those things are kind of rare, so keep your eyes peeled!"
